OL,3,AEl Salvador's president threatens
OL,4,AHaitian gangs over military hostages
OL,5,
OL,6,FEl Salvador's president has said he has
OL,7,Flaunched a military operation to rescue
OL,8,Ffour air force personnel who have been
OL,9,Fmissing in Haiti since Sunday.
OL,11,FThreatening further action, Nayib
OL,12,FBukele said that Wednesday's attack was
OL,13,F"nothing" compared with what would
OL,14,Fhappen if all the hostages - who he
OL,15,Fsaid were not combatants - were not
OL,16,Freturned alive.
OL,18,FThey went missing after being ambushed
OL,19,Fby "heavily armed criminal groups," El
OL,20,FSalvador's armed forces said. The
OL,21,Fambush occurred in Croix-des-Bouquets,
OL,22,Fan area controlled by armed groups.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
